[B]Release 1.4.1 (ID 1040170)[/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]Brand Variant Auto-Switch[/B]: Automatically activates the Brand style ([I]fab[/I]) in the Layout dropdown when selecting a brand icon (e.g. [I]fa-facebook[/I], [I]fa-github[/I]).
[*][B]Style Memory & Restoration[/B]: Remembers the previously active non-brand style ([I]fas[/I], [I]fal[/I], [I]far[/I]) and automatically restores it when selecting a non-brand icon afterwards.
[/LIST]
